@startuml
left to right direction
hide circle
hide methods
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 50
skinparam ranksep 40
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam classBackgroundColor #FFF8E7
skinparam classBorderColor #5D5D5D
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam ArrowThickness 1
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

title Modelo de dominio — asociaciones navegables y multiplicidades

note as LegendNote
  **Leyenda**
  • Flecha sólida → asociación navegable en entidad JPA (campo @ManyToOne / @OneToOne / @ManyToMany)
  • Flecha punteada ..> → navegación solo vía Repository (sin colección en la entidad)
  • Multiplicidades UML: 1, 0..1, *
  • Todas las entidades heredan BaseEntity (id, created_at, updated_at), omitidos por claridad
end note

class AppUser <<entity>> {
  username
  email
  passwordHash
}
note bottom of AppUser : Tabla: users

class Event <<entity>> {
  name
  timeLimitMinutes
  eventCode
  villainDamageTaken
  schemeThreatCurrent
  totalReportedVillainDamage
  timerRemainingSeconds
  timerStatus
  timerStartedAt
  finishCause
  startedAt
  finishedAt
}
note bottom of Event : Tabla: events

class EventVillain <<entity>> {
  name
  type
  hpRuleType
  hpRuleValue
  threatRuleType
  threatRuleValue
}
note bottom of EventVillain : Tabla: villain_instances

class VillainDefinition <<entity>> {
  name
  type
  hpRuleType
  hpRuleValue
  threatRuleType
  threatRuleValue
}
note bottom of VillainDefinition : Tabla: villain_definitions

class Pod <<entity>> {
  name
  sortOrder
}
note bottom of Pod : Tabla: pods

class EventGroup <<entity>> {
  identifier
  playerCount
}
note bottom of EventGroup : Tabla: event_groups

class InterPodCardDefinition <<entity>> {
  name
  type
  cardCategory
  defaultMetricMax
  ruleType
  imagePath
  imageContentType
}
note bottom of InterPodCardDefinition : Tabla: inter_pod_card_definitions

class InterPodCard <<entity>> {
  cardName
  cardCategory
  metricMax
  metricCurrent
  status
  imagePath
  imageContentType
}
note bottom of InterPodCard : Tabla: inter_pod_card_instances

class CoOrganizerInvitation <<entity>> {
  status
  responsibilities
}
note bottom of CoOrganizerInvitation : Tabla: co_organizer_invitations

class EventLog <<entity>> {
  actionType
  previousValue
  newValue
  notes
}
note bottom of EventLog : Tabla: event_logs

' --- Navegación JPA (campos en entidades) ---

Event "0..*" --> "1" AppUser : organizer

Event "1" <--> "0..1" EventVillain : villain / event

EventVillain "0..1" --> "0..1" VillainDefinition : villainDefinition

Event "0..*" --> "0..*" InterPodCardDefinition : selectedInterPodCardDefinitions
note on link
  N:M persistida en
  selected_inter_pod_card_definitions.
  Solo Event navega la asociación
  (@ManyToMany sin mappedBy).
end note

Pod "0..*" --> "1" Event : event

EventGroup "0..*" --> "1" Event : event
EventGroup "0..*" --> "0..1" Pod : pod

InterPodCard "0..*" --> "1" Event : event
InterPodCard "0..*" --> "1" Pod : pod
InterPodCard "0..*" --> "1" EventGroup : sourceGroup
InterPodCard "0..*" --> "0..1" InterPodCardDefinition : interPodCardDefinition

CoOrganizerInvitation "0..*" --> "1" Event : event
CoOrganizerInvitation "0..*" --> "1" AppUser : invitee
CoOrganizerInvitation "0..*" --> "0..1" AppUser : invitedBy

EventLog "0..*" --> "1" Event : event
EventLog "0..*" --> "0..1" EventGroup : group
EventLog "0..*" --> "0..1" AppUser : actor
EventLog "0..*" --> "0..1" EventLog : revertedLog

VillainDefinition "0..*" --> "0..1" AppUser : owner
InterPodCardDefinition "0..*" --> "0..1" AppUser : owner

' --- Navegación vía Repository (sin campo inverso en entidad) ---

AppUser ..> "0..*" Event : organizedEvents\n<<EventRepository.findByOrganizerId>>
AppUser ..> "0..*" CoOrganizerInvitation : receivedInvitations\n<<CoOrganizerInvitationRepository.findByInviteeId>>

Event ..> "0..*" Pod : pods\n<<PodRepository.findByEventId>>
Event ..> "0..*" EventGroup : groups\n<<EventGroupRepository.findByEventId>>
Event ..> "0..*" CoOrganizerInvitation : invitations\n<<CoOrganizerInvitationRepository.findByEventId>>
Event ..> "0..*" EventLog : logs\n<<EventLogRepository.findByEventId>>
Event ..> "0..*" InterPodCard : interPodCards\n<<InterPodCardRepository.findByEventId>>

Pod ..> "0..*" EventGroup : assignedGroups\n<<EventGroupRepository.findByPodId>>
Pod ..> "0..*" InterPodCard : interPodCards\n<<InterPodCardRepository.findByEventIdAndPodId>>

InterPodCardDefinition ..> "0..*" InterPodCard : instances\n<<InterPodCardRepository.findByInterPodCardDefinitionId>>

@enduml
